# DDD Agent Harness — Cursor

This file activates the DDD multi-agent harness for Cursor. It is placed (or symlinked) at the repository root and applies globally to all work in this repo.

---

## Default Entrypoint: Architect

For any business gesture or feature, start with the Architect agent. Load the Architect role before proceeding:

**Role**: `.ai/agents-core/roles/architect.md`

The Architect runs the pipeline in `.ai/agents-core/workflow.md`:
plan (G0) → PO behaviors (G1) → DEV-FS → check (G2) → REVIEW → verdict (G3).

To invoke a specific role directly (for targeted audits), load the corresponding role file before starting work.

---

